{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12153","headline":"东城初陷与薛员外王补阙暝投南山佛寺 · 钱起","name":"东城初陷与薛员外王补阙暝投南山佛寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日昃石门里，松声山寺寒。\n香云空静影，定水无惊湍。\n洗足解尘缨，忽觉天形宽。\n清钟扬虚谷，微月深重峦。\n噫我朝露世，翻浮与波澜。\n行运遘忧患，何缘亲盘桓。\n庶将镜中象，尽作无生观。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}